WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.904 --> 00:00:05.644
Administrators add services in the admin portal.

2
00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:13.299
Give the service a name and a subtitle.

3
00:00:13.299 --> 00:00:21.156
Choose an icon, or combine two.

4
00:00:21.156 --> 00:00:30.598
Decide who may book it: here only one organisation.

5
00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:35.960
Save. Users of that organisation can book it at once.

